│ patch_description        │ The current program achieves perfect accuracy with 26 parameters and very fast            │
│                          │ convergence (30 steps). To improve parameter efficiency while maintaining performance, I  │
│                          │ propose replacing the dual XX-based entanglement (xx_even and xx_odd parameters) with a   │
│                          │ single shared ZZ chain parameter.                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This approach:                                                                            │
│                          │ 1. Reduces parameters from 26 to 20 (4 single-qubit params × 6 repeats + 1 ZZ param × 6   │
│                          │ repeats + 2 readout = 26 → 20)                                                            │
│                          │ 2. Uses a full nearest-neighbor ZZ chain with a single shared parameter, which is known   │
│                          │ to be highly expressive for quantum state classification                                  │
│                          │ 3. Maintains the proven single-qubit rotation structure (RY on even, RZ on odd)           │
│                          │ 4. Simplifies the entanglement pattern to a single, unified approach that has shown       │
│                          │ perfect accuracy in prior programs                                                        │
│                          │ 5. Improves parameter efficiency metric while preserving accuracy and convergence speed   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The ZZ Ising interaction is particularly effective for this task as evidenced by the      │
│                          │ second prior program achieving perfect accuracy with similar structure.                   │
